#!grafli v1
# {{Title}} — concept map
# Companion board to paper.md. Purpose: {{purpose}} — so this board GROWS
# with the understanding: prerequisite -> concept -> consequence, and an
# open question stays on the board as a question rather than being quietly
# dropped. Started {{date}}.
#
# Skeleton. Replace every "…" with the real thing; delete a node only when
# you can say why it does not apply. Keep every key and every scenario name
# here identical to Sandbox.qml, strings.js and paper.md - a board that
# disagrees with the lab teaches the wrong lab.

# ── entry ──
@ box paper "Paper →\nthe study path" 60,60 220x80 %soft &link:./paper.md
@ note legend 900,60 """
colors match the lab
open questions are marked ?
""" ~small

# ── prerequisites ──
@ box pre1 "prerequisite\n…" 60,240 240x110 %muted &link:./paper.md#the-model-at-the-level-i-can-hold-it

# ── the concepts ──
@ box concept "THE CONCEPT\n…" 400,220 260x130 %primary &link:./paper.md#the-question
@ box expected "what I expected\n…\n(kept, wrong or not)" 400,420 260x130 %accent &link:./paper.md#what-i-expected

# ── consequences ──
@ box result "what happens\n…" 760,220 260x130 %teal &link:./paper.md#measured-results
@ box broke "where the intuition broke\n…" 760,420 260x130 %rose &link:./paper.md#where-the-intuition-broke

# ── still open ──
@ box open1 "? …" 400,620 260x110 %highlight &link:./paper.md#still-open

# ── arrows ──
@ arrow pre1 -> concept "needed for"
@ arrow concept -> result
@ arrow expected -> broke "contradicted by" !dashed
@ arrow result -> broke
@ arrow broke -> open1 "opened"

# ── the lab itself ──
@ note scen 60,620 """
scenarios (keys 1-2)
1 intro - …
2 … - …
""" ~small &link:./paper.md#worked-examples

@ note keys 60,800 """
keys
1-2 presets · T tour · F frame · 0 reset
arrows/WASD travel · Shift+arrows turn
Shift+R record · ? every key
""" ~small &link:./paper.md#how-to-run-it
